## ▶️ Run Locally

git clone https://github.com/Heemadhawala-R/MedTwin-AI.git  
cd MedTwin-AI  
pip install -r requirements.txt  
python main.py  

Open:  
http://127.0.0.1:5000

---

## 🧪 Example

Input:
- Age: 20  
- Heart Rate: 100  
- Blood Pressure: 100  
- SpO₂: 100  
- Blood Sugar: 100  

Output:
- Risk Level: Low  
- Health Score: 90  
- Grade: Excellent  
- Insight: Slightly elevated heart rate  

---

## ⚖️ Model Choice

This project uses a Decision Tree Classifier because:

- It is easy to interpret (important in healthcare)  
- It models non-linear relationships effectively  
- It provides clear decision logic  

Future improvements may include ensemble models like Random Forest for better generalization.

